QwenFieldfare

This distribution contains software derived from TurboFieldfare:
https://github.com/drumih/turbo-fieldfare

TurboFieldfare was created by Andrey Mikhaylov and is distributed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0.

This derivative adds Qwen 3.6 35B-A3B model support, Qwen-specific Swift and
Metal inference paths, active-expert caching, validation tools, benchmarks,
documentation, and a Qwen-focused Mac interface.

Model weights are not part of this source distribution. See
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for model and dependency attribution.
